{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_adr_0105", "label": "ADR-0105", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every live Kind, Classification and RelationshipKind string is declared once as a public const in the class that writes it, tracked in a non-enforcing Engineering Vocabulary Register and guarded by one additive xUnit consistency check \u2014 never validated at write time, preserving the open-string contracts of ADR-0072/0073/0076/0088/0091."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_declare_once_as_named_constant", "label": "Declare Once as Named Constant", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Closes the confirmed VerifiedByRelationshipKind duplicate (Desktop re-declaring Core's constant) and every future instance of that shape; public, not internal, so cross-layer consumers can reference rather than copy."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_ownership_by_writer", "label": "Ownership Is Determined by Which Component Writes the Value", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The owner is whichever class calls CreateAsync/LinkAsync with the string, not whichever project compiles the type \u2014 ADR-0078's one-Kind-one-owner test applied one level down."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_engineering_vocabulary_register", "label": "Engineering Vocabulary Register", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lists every live Kind, Classification and RelationshipKind value, its owning constant and a one-line meaning, with the same Review Frequency discipline as Module/Namespace Register \u2014 generalising the WP8.2A catalogues to cover Classification."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_vocabulary_consistency_check", "label": "Vocabulary Consistency Check", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An ordinary xUnit test flagging exactly two conditions: the same value declared as a constant in two classes, and a register value with no declared constant \u2014 a safety net, never a gate."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_open_string_vocabulary", "label": "Open-String Vocabulary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A closed enum cannot scale to an extensible module-defined catalogue without becoming a review bottleneck; rejected five times independently and not reopened here."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_verifiedbyrelationshipkind", "label": "VerifiedByRelationshipKind", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owned by Tempest.Core.Verification.VerificationService; silently re-declared in Tempest.Desktop.DigitalThread.DigitalThreadGraphModel \u2014 the concrete drift instance this ADR closes."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_relationshipkindcategorymap", "label": "RelationshipKindCategoryMap", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing partial safety net: infers RelationshipCategory from 17 known RelationshipKind strings, defaulting non-blockingly to Reference."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_mechanicalobjectfactoryregistry", "label": "MechanicalObjectFactoryRegistry", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Repeats each of its eight Kind strings three times with no declared constant \u2014 the largest retrofit gap, WP 12.1B's first scope item."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_finding_a_6", "label": "WP11.0A Finding A-6", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vocabulary is entirely stringly-typed by design with no compile-time safety net; recommended a lightweight additive safety net."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_wp8_2a_canonical_object_and_relationship_catalogues", "label": "WP8.2A Canonical Object / Relationship Catalogues", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-are-declared-once-as-named-constants-and-tracked-in-a-non-enforcing-governance-register.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0105_engineering_vocabulary_values_are_declared_once_as_named_constants_and_tracked_in_a_non_enforcing_governance_register_classification_and_relationship_vocabulary_safety_net_architecture", "label": "Classification & Relationship Vocabulary Safety Net Architecture.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0105-engineering-vocabulary-values-ar